  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "數位金融行銷",
    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL FINANCIAL SERVICES MARKETING",
    "describe_ch": "在數位金融將成為疫後金融業主流服務的新世代，本課程將引領同學深入了解數位介面優化、數位存款帳戶、智能客服、智能理財、線上融資、社群媒體經營與行銷等實務發展趨勢，並透過分組報告與練習，養成數位行銷的基礎實作能力。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "In the new generation of digital finance will become the mainstream service of the financial industry after the epidemic, this course will lead students to gain an in-depth understanding of practical development trends such as Digital platform optimization, digital deposit accounts, smart customer service, smart financial management, online financing, social media operations and marketing, etc. And through group reports and exercises, students will be trained in the basic practical ability of digital marketing.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
